      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Improvement of diagnostic procedures and control of efficacy are prerequisites for the adequate treatment of malignant ventricular arrhythmias. This necessitates a close cooperation between specialized centers which are mainly involved in the treatment of arrhythmia patients and physicians in private practice. The significance of antiarrhythmic treatment concerning the improvement of prognosis of patients with ventricular arrhythmias has to be defined by follow-up."},
